+    <p>In Roguelike Run, win the most bouts and draft a skill after each one. You have 30 seconds, and the next bout starts when both players lock in. The first card is picked automatically at zero. Classic Duel is first to three wins. Lock-on keeps your rival in view. Drag to aim manually.</p>
+    <p>In Open Meadow, both players have to be inside the gold ring for attacks to deal damage. View chat with <kbd>T</kbd>, or type instantly with <kbd>Enter</kbd>, and open emotes with <kbd>B</kbd>.</p>
